---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import NumerologyCalculator from '../components/NumerologyCalculator.astro';
import GlassButton from '../components/GlassButton.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Numerology & Name Analysis — Astrology with Anisha"
  description="Discover Chaldean numerology with Anisha Banerji. Decode the phonetic sound vibrations of your legal name, business brand, and life path numbers."
  currentPath="/numerology"
>
  <!-- Header -->
  <section class="pt-8 pb-10 sm:pt-12 sm:pb-14 md:pt-14 md:pb-16 lg:pt-16 lg:pb-20 bg-[#fcfbf9] dark:bg-[#090716] border-b border-[#28231e]/10 dark:border-purple-500/20">
    <div class="max-w-4xl xl:max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8">
      <!-- Back to Home Link -->
      <div class="mb-4 sm:mb-6 text-left">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#5a534b] dark:text-[#a8a29a] hover:text-[#110f0d] dark:hover:text-[#ffffff] transition-colors font-medium select-none"
          aria-label="Back to homepage"
        >
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18" />
          </svg>
          <span>Home</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] bg-white/90 dark:bg-purple-950/60 border border-[#28231e]/15 dark:border-purple-500/30 text-[#855b25] dark:text-[#e5c98f] mb-4 shadow-xs">
          <span>Phonetic Resonance & Alignment</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-[#110f0d] dark:text-[#ffffff] tracking-tight leading-tight font-medium">
          Chaldean Numerology
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl text-[#2c2722] dark:text-[#f0ebe1] font-normal max-w-2xl xl:max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          In Vedic science, <em>Nama</em> (name) and <em>Rupa</em> (form) are intrinsically linked. The sound vibration of your name continuously pulses an acoustic frequency through your energetic field.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Interactive Calculator Embedded -->
  <NumerologyCalculator />

  <!-- Educational Section -->
  <section class="py-14 sm:py-18 md:py-20 lg:py-24 xl:py-28 bg-[#faf8f5] dark:bg-[#060410] border-t border-[#28231e]/10 dark:border-purple-500/20">
    <div class="max-w-[1440px] 2xl:max-w-[1560px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8 lg:px-10 xl:px-12">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl xl:max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10 sm:mb-14">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-[#110f0d] dark:text-[#ffffff] font-medium">
          Chaldean vs. Pythagorean Systems
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#38322c] dark:text-[#ded9d0] font-normal mt-2 leading-relaxed">
          Why sound frequency takes precedence over alphabetical sequence.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 sm:gap-8">
        <div class="p-8 rounded-xl bg-white/90 dark:bg-[#0f0b24]/90 border border-[#28231e]/15 dark:border-purple-500/25 shadow-xs">
          <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#855b25] dark:text-[#e5c98f] font-semibold block mb-2">Ancient Mesopotamian & Vedic</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-[#110f0d] dark:text-[#ffffff] font-medium mb-3">The Chaldean System</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#38322c] dark:text-[#ded9d0] font-normal leading-relaxed mb-4">
            The oldest known system of numerology. Values 1 through 8 are assigned according to the acoustic resonance of each consonant and vowel rather than mere sequential order. The number 9 is held as sacred and transcendent.
          </p>
          <ul class="text-xs text-[#5a534b] dark:text-[#a8a29a] space-y-2 border-t border-[#28231e]/10 dark:border-purple-500/20 pt-4 font-medium">
            <li>&bull; Focuses on energetic sound vibration</li>
            <li>&bull; Places immense importance on compound (double-digit) numbers</li>
            <li>&bull; Traditional choice for Indian name corrections & brand naming</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="p-8 rounded-xl bg-white/90 dark:bg-[#0f0b24]/90 border border-[#28231e]/15 dark:border-purple-500/25 shadow-xs">
          <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#855b25] dark:text-[#e5c98f] font-semibold block mb-2">Western Greek Tradition</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-[#110f0d] dark:text-[#ffffff] font-medium mb-3">The Pythagorean System</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#38322c] dark:text-[#ded9d0] font-normal leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Developed by Pythagoras in ancient Greece. Assigns numbers 1 through 9 strictly sequentially (A=1, B=2 ... I=9, J=1). Focuses primarily on life path calculations derived from your Gregorian birth date.
          </p>
          <ul class="text-xs text-[#5a534b] dark:text-[#a8a29a] space-y-2 border-t border-[#28231e]/10 dark:border-purple-500/20 pt-4 font-medium">
            <li>&bull; Sequential alphabetical allocation</li>
            <li>&bull; Strong focus on destiny, soul urge, and personality numbers</li>
            <li>&bull; Widely practiced across modern Western traditions</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Consultation CTA -->
      <div class="mt-16 p-8 rounded-xl bg-white/90 dark:bg-[#0f0b24]/90 border border-[#28231e]/15 dark:border-purple-500/25 text-center max-w-2xl xl:max-w-3xl mx-auto shadow-xs">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#110f0d] dark:text-[#ffffff] mb-2 font-medium">
          Seeking a Professional Name or Brand Analysis?
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#38322c] dark:text-[#ded9d0] font-normal mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          Book a consultation to align your chosen name, professional moniker, or business entity with your birth path numbers.
        </p>
        <GlassButton
          text="Book a Consultation"
          href="/consultations"
        />
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
